{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"DateCustomFields\">Date Custom Fields</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField CustomFields Date DateCustomFields On To ToDate\">Date custom fields capture time-based information with an easy-to-use calendar picker.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Date ExpiryDate On To ToDate View\">Perfect for tracking expiry dates, contract dates, review dates, or any date-based milestones.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Date Is On Port Reports To ToDate\">Date fields help you monitor time-sensitive information and can be used in reports for date-based analysis.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField CustomFields Date DateCustomFields To ToDate\">Setting up Date Custom Fields</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Custom CustomField Date NewCustomField On To ToDate\">To create a new date custom field, click the <strong>New Custom Field</strong> button.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Create Date HasWhere On To ToDate\">Each date field you create can be placed on specific forms and documents where you need to track date information.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField Date Name On To ToDate\">The name of each date custom field as it appears on forms.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Date ExpiryDate Is Name Next On View\">Use descriptive names like <em>Contract Expiry Date</em> or <em>Next Review Date</em> that clearly indicate what date is being tracked.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Date Is\">Shows which forms and documents include this date field.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets Custom Customer Customers Date On Rent To ToDate View\">Date fields can track different dates on different forms — warranty dates on assets, review dates on customers, or renewal dates on contracts.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Date On Rent Select To ToDate Transaction TransactionType Type\">Select multiple forms if you want the same date field to appear across different transaction types.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "date-custom-fields"
